INSERT INTO public."CallLog" (id,"technicianId","callDate",notes,created_at,note,"loggedBy","technicianEmail",legacy_id,legacy_technician_id,metadata,source_system) VALUES (public.m2_legacy_uuid('CallLog:6a3d356a071109aba1efad24'),'42159ce6-ef2f-493b-b621-a38262887262','2026-06-25T14:04:26.874Z','We received the below complaint regarding Michael Alley below which is not real flattering from the Sunbelt PCM.  Pretty sure this isn''t the first time for Michael.  We went through a brief exercise to review the last 6 visits that he has made to this site and sure enough, he hasn''t completed a single installation when there.  Truth is that if there is not anything to do, which I anticipate hearing, then he needs to tell someone and move on to something else.
